    {
      "tr": "Standart hata `s / math.sqrt(n)`.",
      "en": "The standard error is `s / math.sqrt(n)`."
    },
    {
      "tr": "Yalnızca paydayı düzelt.",
      "en": "Fix only the denominator."
    },
    {
      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n```python\nimport math\n\n\ndef t_stat(values, mu0):\n    n = len(values)\n    mean = sum(values) / n\n    s = math.sqrt(sum((x - mean) ** 2 for x in values) / (n - 1))\n    return round((mean - mu0) / (s / math.sqrt(n)), 3)\n\n\nprint(t_stat([910, 860, 845, 930, 880, 905, 870, 925], 850))\nprint(t_stat([5, 7, 6, 8, 4], 5))\n```",
      "en": "The full solution:\n\n```python\nimport math\n\n\ndef t_stat(values, mu0):\n    n = len(values)\n    mean = sum(values) / n\n    s = math.sqrt(sum((x - mean) ** 2 for x in values) / (n - 1))\n    return round((mean - mu0) / (s / math.sqrt(n)), 3)\n\n\nprint(t_stat([910, 860, 845, 930, 880, 905, 870, 925], 850))\nprint(t_stat([5, 7, 6, 8, 4], 5))\n```"
    }
  ],
